      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300410042004C004500590045002100100002011401730000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "In particular, I want to see its eyes. I bet their\nglimmer will bring me sparkling inspiration.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "And so I have to ask you... Do you think you could\nshow me Mega Sableye in a battle?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1048,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "If you need to get your hands on Sableye’s Mega\nStone, you should head over to Quasartico.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0008>",
