    {
      "displayText": "I bet if I saw more Mega Evolutions, I’d get even\nmore ideas!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nAnd you can change your own color contacts\nfrom the main menu whenever you want!<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nJust press <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0005>Minus for “Outfit & Looks,” then press <U+0010><U+0002>봊<U+0002>ZR\nfor all the ways you can alter your looks!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕų",
